ylSaFhOTzCnf5Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBurUiPMkTYvPZtJQjmCQoEr0pdqqhS-7iODcXDNTCaCA&oe=6A5A2DF9"}, {"file_name": "ss_16.29.37.png", "id": "720288710723254", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499308120_720288714056587_5281515250603944197_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=C41e6INN3SoQ7kNvwFTI-5V&_nc_oc=Adpw2nas5nTAOwQQF01lTwwtA0Zs4rToWqaAIEcHcrEZh8KFr8wHfeuPXeSPbN0GKNQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAPhvzhHbRTplHcpTJz-vGyD0Zm5uqcVARlyUN34RcPQg&oe=6A5A1B1F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover.png", "id": "1243676253417307", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/507823854_1243676260083973_1498043803668994539_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RNzh2KEQ4twQ7kNvwHq7GS1&_nc_oc=AdrAuEpAiAZwivktsfCyyqdaU5AhHNcUAocp8pfci1c6VogeZeYEBXFI66VqjSvAUkk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCVcOg58OwKzzuffUjvhKAjM9i2AxpxjHYNmYLtV3GbTw&oe=6A5A2C3C"}, "display_name": "Chemical Equilibrium Simulation", "keywords": ["chemistry", "equilibrium", "simulation", "molecule", "atom"], "long_description": "What happens when you disturb a chemical equilibrium? Find out firsthand. This interactive simulation lets you manipulate the components of an acid dissociation reaction. Add more acid or add more of its conjugate base and instantly see the consequences as the reaction shifts to find a new balance. Challenge yourself to predict the outcome and master the core principles of acid-base chemistry.", "short_description": "Simulation of the dissociation of iodic acid in water and its equilibrium"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://lexobel.com/legal/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Lexobel Co.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://lexobel.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORT